# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# elahub theme .gitignore
# This repo IS the deploy artifact: whatever is committed here is
# what the pipeline publishes into
#   public_html/wp-content/themes/elahub
# So anything ignored here simply never reaches live, and anything
# committed here does. Nothing secret belongs in this tree at all.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Local build dependencies, never deployed. Tailwind v4 is compiled
# ahead of time into output.css, which IS committed. input.css is
# committed too — it is the source of truth for the theme tokens and
# losing it would mean output.css could never be rebuilt.
/node_modules/
/vendor/

# Logs
*.log

# Local editor / OS state
.DS_Store
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Not tracked so a deploy can never wipe the live LiteSpeed /
# php_value directives with a MAMP-adjusted local copy.
/.htaccess
/.htaccess.bk
/.htaccess.disabled

# Never commit a credential into a tree that gets copied onto a
# public webserver. Deploy tokens live in wp-config.php on the
# server and in GitHub repo secrets, never here.
*.env
deploy.env

# Hosting artefacts and stray local state that have no business on live.
/.ftpquota
/.well-known/
